1
00:00:00,630 --> 00:00:01,356
Dead Frequency.

2
00:00:01,606 --> 00:00:06,217
A 2.5D survival horror prototype in Canvas 2D and Next.js.

3
00:00:07,130 --> 00:00:08,203
Three relays are dark.

4
00:00:08,453 --> 00:00:10,517
The exit gate stays sealed until they're back.

5
00:00:11,730 --> 00:00:12,618
You start in reception.

6
00:00:12,868 --> 00:00:16,695
The HUD shows integrity, stamina, threat, and relay pips.

7
00:00:18,030 --> 00:00:20,124
The director speaks only at milestones.

8
00:00:20,374 --> 00:00:23,397
This build labels every scripted line as fallback.

9
00:00:24,230 --> 00:00:25,603
Walk, sprint, listen.

10
00:00:25,853 --> 00:00:28,443
The creature follows the same walls and corridors you do.

11
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:32,031
The flashlight is real canvas lighting.

12
00:00:32,281 --> 00:00:34,214
It also makes you easier for the creature to see.

13
00:00:37,530 --> 00:00:38,452
Relay one online.

14
00:00:38,702 --> 00:00:41,040
The radio feed tags the fallback response.

15
00:00:42,330 --> 00:00:43,135
Pause holds the run.

16
00:00:43,385 --> 00:00:44,516
This is not a full playthrough.
